WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.300
[A low drone, tape hiss and a music box.]

00:00.300 --> 00:01.500
Based on a true story.

00:01.800 --> 00:03.000
For years, it lived among us.

00:03.100 --> 00:04.300
Same colors. Every. Single. Day.

00:04.400 --> 00:05.600
Nobody knew their grade.

00:05.700 --> 00:06.950
And the To Do list… never… ended.

00:07.350 --> 00:08.300
But this Halloween…

00:08.400 --> 00:09.300
BOO! [A skeleton jumps out.]

00:09.500 --> 00:10.100
…hi.

00:10.200 --> 00:11.200
Sorry. We’re just really excited.

00:11.250 --> 00:13.400
New look: Graveyard
Glaze is coming to Canvas.

00:13.650 --> 00:15.600
New look: Pumpkin Patch
Bringing a few friends.

00:15.750 --> 00:17.400
He waves now and then.
He’s very friendly.

00:17.400 --> 00:20.000
Coming soon to Canvas. Happy Halloween.
Free and open source · Chrome and Safari
